# Same-project rewrites the Workers static-asset router cannot express on its
# own. Reproduces the retired CloudFront Function (cdk/lib/web-stack.ts).
#
# Targets are the CANONICAL extensionless paths, not the .html files. Pointing a
# 200 rewrite at `/athletes.html` makes html_handling canonicalize the target and
# emit a 307 to `/athletes`, which drops the slug from the address bar and breaks
# every athlete deep link. Targeting `/athletes` rewrites in place, URL intact.
#
# /favicon.ico is first because splat rules above a literal rule cost a scan.

# App Router emits the icon at /icon (client/app/icon.tsx), never /favicon.ico.
/favicon.ico        /icon      200

# Every athlete slug renders from the shared shell, which reads the slug from
# the URL. The more specific /manage rule must stay above the bare slug rule.
/athletes/*/manage  /athletes  200
/athletes/*         /athletes  200
